                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is FabAlley's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Women-founded + multi-brand strategy + demographic specialisation + trend responsiveness. Early Indian female fashion D2C pioneer.</p>
                                        <h3>FabAlley vs Freakins vs Libas?</h3>
                                        <p>Different segments. FabAlley: modern professional female. Freakins: Gen-Z female. Libas: contemporary ethnic. All coexist by demographic + positioning.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new female fashion brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific niching (sustainable female + Gen-Z sub-culture + regional-language + specific-occasion focus). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest female fashion lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Founder-market fit + demographic specialisation + multi-brand for occasion segments + trend responsiveness combined. Not one-size-fits-all playbook.</p>
